    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin in an empty world \u2014 and it's your purpose to fill it with life. Discover adorable creatures and plants, and breathe music and color into your growing garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/52f3f4378a3222255971db9e4285c6b0.poster.avif?t=1754403537\" width=610 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/52f3f4378a3222255971db9e4285c6b0.webm?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/52f3f4378a3222255971db9e4285c6b0.mp4?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the world are charming minigames and hidden secrets. Help and play with the garden creatures to unlock new areas and decorative elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/d901730a7b601b077c2eaf5b0126c6f4.poster.avif?t=1754403537\" width=608 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/d901730a7b601b077c2eaf5b0126c6f4.webm?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/d901730a7b601b077c2eaf5b0126c6f4.mp4?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each decoration can be combined and reused in multiple ways, giving you countless options to design your garden just the way you like it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/0f9f15069d8908fa770517b00b69616c.poster.avif?t=1754403537\" width=608 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/0f9f15069d8908fa770517b00b69616c.webm?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/0f9f15069d8908fa770517b00b69616c.mp4?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world isn't black and white \u2014 it's your own personal coloring book. Unlock new colors and make the world feel truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/e9aa535ed9f813b90e847da9c305874a.poster.avif?t=1754403537\" width=608 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/e9aa535ed9f813b90e847da9c305874a.webm?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/e9aa535ed9f813b90e847da9c305874a.mp4?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the soft music, playful sounds, and calm atmosphere invite you to stay a while. <i>Garden Ink</i> is a cozy world made for slowing down and simply enjoying your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin in an empty world \u2014 and it's your purpose to fill it with life. Discover adorable creatures and plants, and breathe music and color into your growing garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/52f3f4378a3222255971db9e4285c6b0.poster.avif?t=1754403537\" width=610 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/52f3f4378a3222255971db9e4285c6b0.webm?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/52f3f4378a3222255971db9e4285c6b0.mp4?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the world are charming minigames and hidden secrets. Help and play with the garden creatures to unlock new areas and decorative elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/d901730a7b601b077c2eaf5b0126c6f4.poster.avif?t=1754403537\" width=608 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/d901730a7b601b077c2eaf5b0126c6f4.webm?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/d901730a7b601b077c2eaf5b0126c6f4.mp4?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each decoration can be combined and reused in multiple ways, giving you countless options to design your garden just the way you like it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/0f9f15069d8908fa770517b00b69616c.poster.avif?t=1754403537\" width=608 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/0f9f15069d8908fa770517b00b69616c.webm?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/0f9f15069d8908fa770517b00b69616c.mp4?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world isn't black and white \u2014 it's your own personal coloring book. Unlock new colors and make the world feel truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/e9aa535ed9f813b90e847da9c305874a.poster.avif?t=1754403537\" width=608 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/e9aa535ed9f813b90e847da9c305874a.webm?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/e9aa535ed9f813b90e847da9c305874a.mp4?t=1754403537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the soft music, playful sounds, and calm atmosphere invite you to stay a while. <i>Garden Ink</i> is a cozy world made for slowing down and simply enjoying your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31\ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3f\ud83c\udf31</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
